6045417] [17592186402441 #edb/ref 1071 "What is the trace in the $yz$-plane of the elliptic paraboloid $z=\\frac{{x}^{2}}{8}+\\frac{(y-1)^{2}}{27}.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186402441 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "69276016-ba7c-50d9-a595-a7d6a823a97c" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186402441 #edb/ref 1074 "To find the trace in the $yz$-plane, we substitute $x=0$ into the equation of the paraboloid, and simplify:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}z & =\\frac{{0}^{2}}{8}+\\frac{(y-1)^{2}}{27} \\\\ z & =\\frac{1}{27}(y-1)^{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nThis gives us the equation of the parabola in $yz$-plane." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186402442 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186402443 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186402442 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186402444 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186402442 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186402445 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186402442 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186402446 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186402442 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186402447 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186402442 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186402442 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186402442 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186402443 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186402442 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "adcc4a54-ddf6-5374-9d97-b2333d8e09c8" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186402443 #edb/ref 1080 "A parabola: $z=\\frac{1}{27}(y-1)^{2}$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186402443 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186402443 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "7aa6485c-6c26-5611-afdf-703d5d2c4fe8" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186402444 #edb/ref 1080 "Two intersecting lines: $y=\\pm 3(x+2)$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186402444 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186402444 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "94e8800d-2d94-543f-9790-e394e9982e93" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186402445 #edb/ref 1080 "Two parallel lines: $x=3(z\\pm 1)$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [1759218640